==================
About this fork
==================

This repository is a maintained rebuild of the mscorefonts2 project published
on SourceForge by Rob Janes. The imported files are from the last SourceForge
release from 2013 (msttcore-fonts-installer 2.6-1). SourceForge provided
downloadable project files rather than the original version-control history,
so the initial Git commit is a snapshot of those files, not a reconstruction
of the upstream commit history.

I rebuilt the package to remove the install-time HTTP requests made by the
original installer RPM. Those requests could fail during installation and
made installing the package depend on a network transfer. The rebuilt RPM
includes all required font files and generates their font indexes at build
time, making installation self-contained and independent of SourceForge
mirrors, subject to the fonts' redistribution terms.

See docs/RELEASE.md for build and release instructions.

===============
How to Install
===============

Build and test the RPM with:

    make rpm

The generated RPM is written to `rpms/`. Installing it does not require
network access to the SourceForge mirrors.

Install the generated package with:

    sudo rpm -i rpms/msttcore-fonts-installer-2.7-<release>.noarch.rpm

The RPM version is read from the root `VERSION` file. The RPM release number
is the number of commits reachable from `HEAD`, as reported by
`git rev-list --count HEAD`.

`make rpm` builds the package and exports the RPM and SRPM from a Fedora 43
container.

============
Description
============
This installs the TrueType core fonts for the web that were once
available from http://www.microsoft.com/typography/fontpack/ prior
to 2002, and most recently updated in the European Union Expansion
Update circa May 2007, still available on the Microsoft website.
This also installs Microsoft's ClearType fonts, see
http://www.microsoft.com/typography/ClearTypeFonts.mspx for more info.

With this rpm the font payload is included in the package and installed
directly. The fonts are added to the core X fonts system as well as the Xft
font system.

These are the fonts added:

    1998 Andale Mono
    2006 Arial: bold, bold italic, italic, regular
    1998 Arial: black
    2007 Calabri: bold, bold italic, italic, regular
    2007 Cambria: bold, bold italic, italic
    2007 Candara: bold, bold italic, italic, regular
    2007 Consolas: bold, bold italic, italic, regular
    2007 Constantia: bold, bold italic, italic, regular
    2007 Corbel: bold, bold italic, italic, regular
    1998 Comic: bold, regular
    2000 Courier: bold, bold italic, italic, regular
    1998 Impact
    2006 Times: bold, bold italic, italic, regular
    2006 Trebuchet: bold, bold italic, italic, regular
    2006 Verdana: bold, bold italic, italic, regular
    1998 Webdings

